  "notes": "Zone channels 1-16 are assumed (each zone's Receive Channel is a setting; the document gives no factory default). Scenes: Bank Select 85/LSB 0 = A001-A128, LSB 1 = B001-B128 (the document elides further banks); scenes are presumably selected on the Scene Control Channel (SYSTEM, 1-16 or OFF; the MIDI document does not say so outright, so check the Reference Manual), and Receive Program Change/Bank Select must be On in SYSTEM:MIDI. Tones per zone: Bank Select MSB 87 (User LSB 0, Preset B 64, C 68, D 69, E 78, CMN 85, A 92), MSB 89 SN-A (User 0, Preset 65), MSB 91 VTW (User 0, Preset 65), MSB 86 drum kits (User LSB 0, Preset A 64, CMN 65); program 1-128, sent on the zone's channel. Clock in needs Sync Mode EXTERNAL; Start/Stop/Continue also work in REMOTE; clock out needs Sync Output On. Polyphony and the Scene Control Channel's factory default are not stated in Roland's spec page, MIDI Implementation or Reference Manual."
